Slice 245, R-R14 (DESIGN-CLI.md 6.6): the one operand of `--git` (entry `commands`, one line of `fx/commands` for each run). The fake API has no `commits/` route, so a commit request would be in calls.log
(and get 404). The nightly list is there for the last run only. `config.toml` has a default. No `fx/jobs` and no `fx/src/`: a source build cannot start.

